Package: echoverse
Title: Client for EPA ECHO, Envirofacts and ArcGIS Web Services
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sean", "Thimons", email = "thimons.sean@gmail.com",
        role = c('aut', 'cre'))
Description: Generated client for the U.S. EPA Enforcement and Compliance
    History Online (ECHO), Envirofacts (DMAP), and public ArcGIS mapping
    services (32 APIs, 1030 operations), built with specmill from local
    Swagger and OpenAPI schemas and reviewed ArcGIS metadata.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: httr2 (>= 1.3.0), jsonlite, curl, tibble, digest
Suggests: testthat, sf, knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
URL: https://seanthimons.github.io/epaechoverse/, https://github.com/seanthimons/epaechoverse
BugReports: https://github.com/seanthimons/epaechoverse/issues
